    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Fluxos de aforro r\u00e1pido para enchufes intelixentes e dispositivos centrados na enerx\u00eda.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
