    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Crea un panel de aforro de enerx\u00eda que xestione enchufes intelixentes e dispositivos consumidores de enerx\u00eda. Engade apagado r\u00e1pido, perf\u00eds ecol\u00f3xicos, aforro programado e resumos de uso.\\nDespertador intelixente", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
