    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Despois de introducir os teus datos, podes restablecer facilmente a t\u00faa contrasinal seguindo os pasos que enviamos.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Usa a aplicaci\u00f3n de escritorio NEXUS no teu computador; o mesmo asistente e controis tam\u00e9n funcionan al\u00ed.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Chatea desde o teu computador tam\u00e9n; as t\u00faas conversas mant\u00e9\u00f1ense sincronizadas entre os teus dispositivos.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Unirse a un fogar", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Cando un dispositivo se acende ou apaga", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Toque un dispositivo para abrir a pantalla de control do panel; mostra s\u00f3 as funci\u00f3ns que ese dispositivo admite. Para dispositivos Shelly, WLED e ESPHome, o acendido/apagado e o brillo van directamente ao dispositivo.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Este c\u00f3digo util\u00edzase na pantalla Unirse a un fogar.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "S\u00f3 se necesita un toque", // EN: One tap is all it takes
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturdu\u011funda saat ve aksiyonlar burada ger\u00e7ek verilerle g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Unha vez que crees un plan, os tempos e acci\u00f3ns aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed con datos reais.", // EN: Once you create a plan, times and actions will appear here with real data.
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturunca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Aparecer\u00e1 aqu\u00ed unha vez que crees un plan.", // EN: It will appear here once you create a plan.
