    "Bize d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnceni yaz...": "Dinos o que pensas...", // EN: Tell us what you think...
    "Br\u00fcksel": "Bruxelas", // EN: Brussels
    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Este c\u00f3digo de 8 d\u00edxitos \u00e9 para emparellamento con Apple HomeKit e s\u00f3 funciona coa aplicaci\u00f3n Apple Home. Se o dispositivo admite unha API local como Shelly, WLED ou Tasmota, podes engadilo desde a t\u00faa rede local.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Este dispositivo", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Este c\u00f3digo QR pertence a unha rede Wi-Fi, non a un dispositivo. Despois de conectar o dispositivo \u00e1 mesma rede, podes engadilo desde a t\u00faa rede local.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Non se atopou ning\u00fan dispositivo NEXUS co\u00f1ecido nesta direcci\u00f3n. Aseg\u00farate de que o dispositivo est\u00e1 acendido e na mesma rede.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Crea esta aplicaci\u00f3n intelixente:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Preparando funci\u00f3ns suxeridas para este fluxo.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "G\u00e1rdase este mes", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Non se atopou ning\u00fan dispositivo compatible nesta rede.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Non se atopou ning\u00fan dispositivo compatible nesta rede. Aseg\u00farate de que o dispositivo est\u00e1 acendido e conectado \u00e1 mesma Wi-Fi; do contrario, usa o cat\u00e1logo a continuaci\u00f3n ou un c\u00f3digo QR / de configuraci\u00f3n.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Protecci\u00f3n local para este dispositivo", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Este dispositivo non comparte informaci\u00f3n da versi\u00f3n", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Este dispositivo ou conexi\u00f3n non soporta a lanterna.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Este dispositivo non soporta localizaci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Este c\u00f3digo de invitaci\u00f3n non se atopou.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Esta pantalla agrupa os dispositivos de iluminaci\u00f3n que engadiches por habitaci\u00f3n; ao gardar unha escena, o brillo e o ton config\u00farase xuntos.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Os dispositivos que engades nesta casa aparecen listados aqu\u00ed.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Os dispositivos que engades nesta casa aparecen listados aqu\u00ed e vinculados \u00e1s t\u00faas tarxetas favoritas.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "\u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro de que queres eliminar permanentemente esta casa e todos os seus axustes?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Este c\u00f3digo non \u00e9 un c\u00f3digo de dispositivo compatible. Se co\u00f1eces o enderezo IP do dispositivo, podes engadilo dende a t\u00faa rede local.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Estas marcas est\u00e1n controladas a trav\u00e9s da t\u00faa rede local.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Esta mini aplicaci\u00f3n \u00e9 proporcionada polo provedor oficial.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Este contorno non admite acceso \u00e1 c\u00e1mara.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "A exploraci\u00f3n da rede non est\u00e1 dispo\u00f1ible aqu\u00ed.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "Non hai cifrado seguro neste contorno.", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Cando se execute este escenario, os dispositivos relacionados axustaranse automaticamente.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Ning\u00fan dispositivo se ve afectado por este escenario: engade primeiro un dispositivo axeitado.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Necesitas engadir un dispositivo compatible para usar este escenario.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Esta \u00e9 a t\u00faa \u00fanica casa. Se a eliminas, crearase de novo un \"Meu Fogar\" baleiro. Continuar?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
