    "Bulut hesab\u0131na ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Non se puido conectar \u00e1 conta da nube. Comproba a t\u00faa conexi\u00f3n a internet.", // EN: Couldn't reach the cloud account. Check your internet connection.
    "Buluta ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Non se puido conectar \u00e1 nube. Comproba a t\u00faa conexi\u00f3n a internet.", // EN: Couldn't reach the cloud. Check your internet connection.
    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "Non puiden resolver iso completamente. Env\u00eda comentarios ao noso equipo co formulario de abaixo e responderemos o antes posible, ou contin\u00faa con \"Abrir chat completo\".", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
