    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "Desencadea automaticamente outros escenarios cando cambie o estado dos teus dispositivos.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Obte\u00f1a informaci\u00f3n sobre os seus dispositivos e aforre automaticamente con estratexias.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Pode engadir os seus dispositivos con detecci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica, c\u00f3digo QR, c\u00f3digo de configuraci\u00f3n ou o cat\u00e1logo manual.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
