    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "\u00bfPor que o meu dispositivo aparece como desconectado?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Escriba a direcci\u00f3n IP do dispositivo e NEXUS determinar\u00e1 que protocolo utiliza.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Verifique a conexi\u00f3n Wi-Fi do dispositivo e o seu enrutador. Se o problema contin\u00faa, elimine o dispositivo e agr\u00e9gueo novamente. Pasos: Dispositivos > seleccionar o dispositivo > Eliminar.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Verifique a conexi\u00f3n Wi-Fi do dispositivo e o seu enrutador. Se o problema contin\u00faa, elimine o dispositivo da aplicaci\u00f3n NEXUS e agr\u00e9gueo novamente.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Se o seu dispositivo non aparece, use o escaneo de QR ou un c\u00f3digo de configuraci\u00f3n. Pode abrir a p\u00e1xina de axuda para soporte e orientaci\u00f3n.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "O servizo de localizaci\u00f3n (GPS) do teu dispositivo est\u00e1 apagado. Ac\u00e9ndeo e int\u00e9ntao de novo.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "O teu dispositivo non \u00e9 compatible cos servizos de localizaci\u00f3n.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
