    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Apaga todos os grupos de iluminaci\u00f3n que quedaran acendidos no fogar.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "No fogar e f\u00f3ra", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "F\u00f3ra", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Cando esteas f\u00f3ra", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Xestiona as luces do teu fogar habitaci\u00f3n por habitaci\u00f3n nun fluxo \u00fanico. Encendido/apagado, brillo, temperatura de cor e atalli\u00f1os de escenas r\u00e1pidas nunha soa aplicaci\u00f3n.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "D\u00e1 comandos preparados, automatizaci\u00f3ns r\u00e1pidas e suxesti\u00f3ns intelixentes de aplicaci\u00f3ns baseadas nos dispositivos da casa.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Crea unha aplicaci\u00f3n de confort clim\u00e1tico que xestione os AC e termostatos da t\u00faa casa desde un \u00fanico panel. Incl\u00fae control de temperatura, modos r\u00e1pidos, modo eco e acci\u00f3ns baseadas nas habitaci\u00f3ns.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Cal \u00e9 o estado dos meus dispositivos?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "F\u00f3ra da Casa", // EN: Away from Home
