    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Engadir dispositivos Matter require un controlador Matter, que NEXUS a\u00ednda non ofrece. Se o dispositivo se conecta a trav\u00e9s de Wi-Fi, pode engadilo desde a s\u00faa rede local pola s\u00faa direcci\u00f3n IP.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
