    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ a\u00ednda non est\u00e1 \u00e1 venda. Engadir dispositivos, escenarios e NEXUS AI \u00e9 completamente gratu\u00edto neste momento; avisar\u00e9mosche aqu\u00ed cando se abran as subscrici\u00f3ns.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
