    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Hai un dispositivo nesta direcci\u00f3n, pero non fala un protocolo NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Este dispositivo xa est\u00e1 engadido.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Emparellar e engadir", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "O c\u00f3digo de emparellamento non \u00e9 v\u00e1lido. Introduza o c\u00f3digo de 11 d\u00edxitos ou o contido do QR que comeza con MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Introduza este c\u00f3digo na aplicaci\u00f3n de escritorio NEXUS. Se o dispositivo est\u00e1 en Wi-Fi, tam\u00e9n pode engadilo desde a s\u00faa rede local mediante a s\u00faa direcci\u00f3n IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "O dispositivo est\u00e1 a ser buscado na mesma rede e emparellado. Isto pode levar ata un minuto; o dispositivo debe estar acendido e en modo de emparellamento.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "O dispositivo non se encontrou ou non se puido emparellar. Aseg\u00farese de que est\u00e1 na mesma rede, acendido e en modo de emparellamento.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "O dispositivo non se encontrou. Aseg\u00farese de que est\u00e1 na mesma rede, acendido e en modo de emparellamento. O cortalumes do seu ordenador pode estar bloqueando respostas de dispositivos na rede local.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Non se puido emparellar o dispositivo. Comprobe o c\u00f3digo de emparellamento e que o dispositivo est\u00e1 en modo de emparellamento.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "O dispositivo emparellouse pero non ten funci\u00f3n que NEXUS poida controlar.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "O dispositivo non respondeu. Aseg\u00farese de que est\u00e1 acendido e na mesma rede.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
