    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Crear unha aplicaci\u00f3n de modo cine para TVs e dispositivos multimedia. Incl\u00fae iniciar pel\u00edcula, volume, luces ambientais e atallos para entretemento sen distracci\u00f3ns pola noite.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Panel de entretemento cun s\u00f3 toque para TVs e dispositivos multimedia.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "TVs, altofalantes e dispositivos de entretemento", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Combina a TV, a caixa de medios e as luces ambientais nunha acci\u00f3n. Facilita configurar iniciar pel\u00edcula, modo nocturno e escenas de entretemento sen distracci\u00f3ns.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Por suposto! Podo xuntar un gran escenario intelixente para ti. Poder\u00edas darme alg\u00fans detalles? Por exemplo: \"Inicia a cafeteira cando me espertar\" ou \"Aten\u00faa completamente as luces cando vexa unha pel\u00edcula\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
