    "Temizlik ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS AI, yerdeki engelleri alg\u0131layacak ve ses seviyesini odadaki doluluk durumuna g\u00f6re otomatik ayarlayacakt\u0131r.": "Cando comeza a limpeza, NEXUS AI detecta obst\u00e1culos no chan e axusta o volume automaticamente en funci\u00f3n da ocupaci\u00f3n da habitaci\u00f3n.", // EN: When cleaning starts, NEXUS AI detects obstacles on the floor and adjusts the volume automatically based on room occupancy.
