    "T\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 tek bir merkezden, sesinizle veya otomatik senaryolarla y\u00f6netin.": "Xestiona todos os teus dispositivos desde un s\u00f3 lugar, coa t\u00faa voz ou con escenarios autom\u00e1ticos.", // EN: Manage all your devices from one place, with your voice or with automatic scenarios.
    "T\u00fcm evi oda bazl\u0131 kontrol eden bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131k paneli olu\u015ftur. Her oda i\u00e7in ac/kapat, parlakl\u0131k ve renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 kontrolleri olsun. Hemen kullan\u0131labilecek h\u0131zl\u0131 yuzdeler ve tumunu ac/tumunu kapat aksiyonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Crea un panel de iluminaci\u00f3n intelixente que controle toda a casa habitaci\u00f3n por habitaci\u00f3n. Incl\u00fae controis de acendido/apagado, brillo e temperatura de cor para cada habitaci\u00f3n. Engade porcentaxes r\u00e1pidas listas para usar e acci\u00f3ns de todo acendido/todo apagado.", // EN: Create a smart lighting panel that controls the whole home room by room. Include on/off, brightness and color temperature controls for each room. Add ready-to-use quick percentages and all on/all off actions.
