    "Uyan\u0131nca \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, iklim ve m\u00fczi\u011fi tek dokunu\u015fla ba\u015flat.": "Inicia luces, persianas, clima e m\u00fasica cunha soa pulsaci\u00f3n ao espertar.", // EN: Start lights, blinds, climate and music with one tap when you wake up.
