    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge ve temizlik cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in g\u00fcn ve oda plan\u0131.": "Plans de d\u00eda e de habitaci\u00f3n para aspiradoras rob\u00f3ticas e dispositivos de limpeza.", // EN: Day and room plans for robot vacuums and cleaning devices.
    "Sulama saatleri, b\u00f6lgeler ve sens\u00f6r verisiyle ak\u0131ll\u0131 plan.": "Programaci\u00f3n intelixente de rega, zonas e planificaci\u00f3n baseada en sensores.", // EN: Smart watering schedules, zones and sensor-driven planning.
    "Sens\u00f6r verisiyle havaland\u0131rma ve temizleyiciyi otomatik y\u00f6net.": "Xestiona ventilaci\u00f3n e purificadores automaticamente a partir dos datos dos sensores.", // EN: Manage ventilation and purifiers automatically from sensor data.
