    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Agrupa todos os controis do fogar que necesites antes de durmir nun \u00fanico centro. Aten\u00faa as luces, non molestar, comprobaci\u00f3n do cerroxo e axustes de clima nocturno nunha \u00fanica pantalla.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Crea un centro de preparaci\u00f3n para a hora de durmir que xestione luces, modo silencioso, trancas e clima antes de ir \u00e1 cama. Engade un resumo final de comprobaci\u00f3n e un modo nocturno de un s\u00f3 toque.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
