    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Cea", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Abrir as cortinas", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Pechar as portas", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Acende todas as luces ao m\u00e1ximo brillo.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Apaga todas as luces.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Acende as luces ao m\u00e1ximo brillo cun ton di\u00farno.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Ajusta as luces ao 85% cun ton neutro e apaga a TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Todas as noites 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Acende o aire acondicionado a 20\u00b0 e axusta o termostato a 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Axusta o termostato a un axuste de confort de 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Entre semana 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Abre todas as cortinas e persianas.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Todos os d\u00edas ao amencer", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Pecha todas as cortinas e persianas.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Todos os d\u00edas ao solpor", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Fecha todas as peches intelixentes (as peches nunca se desbloquean).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Apaga as luces e a TV; deixa os enchufes e o aire acondicionado sen tocar.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Acender ou apagar un dispositivo", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Env\u00eda un comando ao dispositivo que elixas.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
