    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Acender", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Apagar", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Escolle o dispositivo a controlar.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Consulta a calidade do aire, a temperatura e a humidade que miden os teus sensores, e controla o teu purificador.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Prepara luces, cortinas e aire acondicionado para o d\u00eda cun s\u00f3 toque.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Acende luces, cortinas e climatizaci\u00f3n xuntas cando chegas a casa.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Pon os teus dispositivos nun estado seguro e aforrador de enerx\u00eda mentres est\u00e1s f\u00f3ra durante moito tempo.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Aten\u00faa as luces, pecha as cortinas e acende a televisi\u00f3n.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Inicia o teu robot aspirador ou env\u00edao de volta \u00e1 s\u00faa base.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Pecha a porta, corre as cortinas e prepara a casa para a noite.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Vexa o estado e a configuraci\u00f3n de privacidade das t\u00faas c\u00e1maras nunha soa pantalla.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Activa ou desactiva o modo de privacidade das t\u00faas c\u00e1maras desde un soa lugar mentres est\u00e1s na casa.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Vexa que automatizaci\u00f3ns se executan hoxe.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Comparte notas e tarefas coa t\u00faa familia.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Vexa o resumo de sa\u00fade da t\u00faa casa a partir do aire, a humidade e a temperatura que miden os teus sensores.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Comprobe se \u00e9 posible acceder aos teus dispositivos a trav\u00e9s da rede local.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
