    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Esta acci\u00f3n necesita verificaci\u00f3n extra. Podes solicitar un enlace para configurar o contrasinal a continuaci\u00f3n.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
