    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "\u00daltimos 7 d\u00edas", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "A\u00ednda non se rexistraron medici\u00f3ns. Engade un dispositivo que mida a enerx\u00eda e abre esta p\u00e1xina; as lecturas acumularanse aqu\u00ed.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Os intervalos sen medici\u00f3ns non se contan, polo que os valores poden ser inferiores ao consumo real.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
