    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "O t\u00edtulo e o texto curto dos eventos de seguridade/emergencia neste dispositivo aparecen nas aplicaci\u00f3ns doutros membros desta casa. Os detalles do dispositivo e as chaves nunca se comparten; cada membro segue a s\u00faa propia configuraci\u00f3n de notificaci\u00f3ns.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Sa\u00edr da casa", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Sa\u00edr", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Introduce o c\u00f3digo do correo electr\u00f3nico de invitaci\u00f3n. O c\u00f3digo \u00e9 de uso \u00fanico e s\u00f3 funciona coa direcci\u00f3n de correo electr\u00f3nico invitada.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Requ\u00edrese inicio de sesi\u00f3n", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Inicia sesi\u00f3n primeiro para invitar membros; conectar\u00e1s automaticamente \u00e1 conta do teu fogar.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "O correo electr\u00f3nico non puido enviarse desde o servidor", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "A invitaci\u00f3n foi creada pero o correo autom\u00e1tico non puido enviarse. Preparamos o texto da invitaci\u00f3n coa t\u00faa aplicaci\u00f3n de correo?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
