    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Non se puido conectar ao dispositivo. Aseg\u00farate de que est\u00e1 na mesma rede.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Non se puido conectar ao dispositivo. Aseg\u00farate de que est\u00e1 na mesma rede e de que a direcci\u00f3n IP e a chave local son correctas.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Acende as luces con un ton c\u00e1lido, abre as cortinas e configura o aire acondicionado a 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Acende as luces e abre as cortinas, pon o aire acondicionado a 22\u00b0 e devolve o aspirador \u00e1 carga.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Apaga as luces, a TV e o aire acondicionado, pecha as cortinas e bloquea a porta.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Apaga as luces e a televisi\u00f3n, pecha as cortinas e pecha a porta con chave.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Configura as luces nun ton c\u00e1lido ao 15%, pecha as cortinas e acende a televisi\u00f3n.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Pecha a porta con chave e pecha as cortinas.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Acende as luces ao 70% de brillo.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Inicia o robot de limpeza.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Entre semana \u00e1s 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Configura o aire acondicionado e o termostato en modo de confort e pon en funcionamento o purificador de aire.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Env\u00eda unha notificaci\u00f3n", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Este escenario non afecta a ning\u00fan dos teus dispositivos actuais. Para facelo funcionar, engade un dispositivo adecuado (por exemplo, unha luz, cortina ou aspiradora).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Crea un fogar novo ou \u00faneste a un co c\u00f3digo de invitaci\u00f3n que che enviaron.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Non iniciaches sesi\u00f3n. Os fogares g\u00e1rdanse s\u00f3 neste dispositivo. Inicia sesi\u00f3n para invitar membros, unirte a un fogar e usar o chat familiar.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
